Initialization: For UAVj ∈ M

1. Randomly initialize actor network πj(oj(0) |) with parameter {θπj}, critic network Qj(s(0), a(0) | θqj) with parameter {θQj};

2. Randomly initialize corresponding target networks π′j(·) and Q′j(·) with parameters θπ′j = θπj and θQ′j = θQj, respectively;

3. Initialize prioritized replay buffer Bj;

for episode= 1, . . . , kmax do

Initialize environment and receive state s(0);
for time slot t = 1, . . . , T do

for UAV j ∈ M do

    Formulate local observation oj(t), and execute flying action aj(t) according to current policy πj(oj(t) | θπj) + N;
    Collect action a(t) = (aj(t)) |j∈M and reward (rj(t)) |j∈M, and transition to the new state s(t+1);
    Constitute the experience (s(t), a(t),j(t), s(t+1)), and store it in replay buffer Bj with its priority (δj(t) + ε);
    if the number of experiences in replay buffer Bj is bigger than batch size then

    Sample H experiences from replay buffer Bj by probability pj(h) to form a mini-batch;
    Calculate the TD-error and importance sampling weight wj(h) of each experience;
    Update network parameters according to Algorithm 2;
    end
    end
end

